[2026-01-30T00:03:32.757Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01HdTijn4nHUAgw18MCZ1BB9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI analyzed the Report Interactive Features context in the \"res\" codebase and generated **5 moonshot ideas** that were saved to Vibeman's database.\n\n### Ideas Created:\n\n1. **AI Research Co-Pilot: Real-Time Interactive Dialogue** (Impact: 10, Effort: 9, Risk: 7)\n   - Transform passive report reading into active conversation with the research\n   - Users can ask questions, request deeper analysis, generate hypotheticals\n\n2. **Predictive Reading Path: AI-Guided Research Navigation** (Impact: 9, Effort: 8, Risk: 5)\n   - AI predicts what users need to read next based on role and patterns\n   - Personalized paths: Executive, Due Diligence, Technical Deep-Dive\n\n3. **Live Research Stream: Real-Time Update Feed** (Impact: 10, Effort: 10, Risk: 8)\n   - Transform static reports into living streams with auto-updating findings\n   - Bloomberg terminal meets research reports\n\n4. **Neural Reading Mode: Brain-Optimized Information Absorption** (Impact: 8, Effort: 9, Risk: 6)\n   - Scientifically-designed reading with eye tracking, adaptive pacing, memory anchoring\n   - Optimize for retention, not just speed\n\n5. **Immersive Research Theater: 3D Spatial Information Environment** (Impact: 9, Effort: 10, Risk: 9)\n   - Navigate research findings in 3D space with WebXR\n   - Collaborative presence for team exploration\n\n### Codebase Observations:\n\n- The existing features (FocusMode, SpeedReader, IntelDashboard, KeyPointsPanel) provide solid foundational reading tools with excellent theming support (radar/swiss themes)\n- SpeedReader uses RSVP (Rapid Serial Visual Presentation) with focal point highlighting - scientifically grounded\n- The codebase already has sophisticated visualization components (NetworkGraph, CausalFlow, EntityConstellation) that could support advanced interactive features\n- The Bayesian confidence system just implemented provides a perfect foundation for the \"AI Research Co-Pilot\" idea"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":897,"cache_read_input_tokens":144431,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":897},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"dfcca2d3-ccca-480b-9d84-e27821b4b51a"}
